    "summary": "Use it in any phase, just after rolling 1 of these for a unit or model of yours:\n\n- an [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), Charge, Damage, [Hazard](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls), [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), [Save](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls) or **[Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**\n- the roll for how many attacks a weapon makes\n\nRe-roll it. If several dice were rolled together, re-roll just 1 of them, except a **[Charge roll](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)**, which is re-rolled in full. Like every Stratagem, you [cannot use it again in the same phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
